			"notes": "# Methil More Ores v0.1.3b\n\nWelcome to the **Methil More Ores** mod for **Minecraft 1.21.1**, powered by **NeoForge** and **Kotlin For Forge**! This update brings a creative new addition to enhance your Minecraft experience.\n\n## New in v0.1.3b\n- **New Painting**:  \n   Introducing the **1x1 Methil More Ores v0.1.1b** painting! Decorate your world with this unique artwork inspired by the mod.\n\n## Installation Steps\n1. Install **NeoForge**.\n2. Download the **Methil More Ores** mod.\n3. Place the file in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n4. Launch Minecraft and enjoy the new features!\n\n## Support\nFor help or to report issues, visit our **[GitHub](https://github.com/methil-mods/methil-more-ores)**.\n\nHappy mining, crafting, and decorating!"
		},
