			"notes": "# Methil More Ores v0.1.1b\n\nWelcome to the **Methil More Ores** mod for Minecraft 1.21.1, powered by **NeoForge** and **Kotlin For Forge**! This update focuses on improving the Starlight Methil Armor effect.\n\n## New in v0.1.1b\n\n- **Starlight Methil Armor Effect Update**: The full **Starlight Methil Armor** set (Helmet, Chestplate, Leggings, and Boots) now grants the powerful **Methil Effect** instead of **Absorption IV**. This custom effect enhances your defense and combat skills, providing a unique advantage when fully geared up.\n\n## Installation Steps\n1. Install NeoForge.\n2. Download the Methil More Ores mod.\n3. Place the file in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n4. Launch Minecraft and enjoy the new features!\n\nFor support, report bugs on our [GitHub](https://github.com/methil-mods/methil-more-ores). Happy mining and battling!"
		},
