			"notes": "# Methil More Ores v0.1.0b\nWelcome to the **Methil More Ores** mod for Minecraft 1.21.1, powered by **NeoForge** and **Kotlin For Forge**! This update introduces new powerful items and tools to enhance your mining and combat experience.\n\n## New in v0.1.0b\n\n- **Starlight Methil Armor**: A celestial armor set forged from the rare Nether Star and Methil, offering superior protection and granting **Absorption IV**. Equip the Helmet, Chestplate, Leggings, and Boots to unlock the full power of the stars.\n- **Starlight Methil Item**: Crafted by combining a **Nether Star** with a **Methil Item**, this rare material is used to create the powerful Starlight Methil gear.\n- **Starlight Methil Tools**: Along with the armor, new tools crafted from Starlight Methil are now available, including:\n  - **Starlight Methil Sword**: A powerful weapon with enhanced durability and strength.\n  - **Starlight Methil Pickaxe**: A tool capable of mining even the toughest blocks with ease.\n  - **Starlight Methil Axe, Shovel, and Hoe**: Efficient tools for all your crafting and resource-gathering needs.\n\n## Installation Steps\n1. Install NeoForge.\n2. Download the Methil More Ores mod.\n3. Place the file in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n4. Launch Minecraft and enjoy the new features!\n\nFor support, report bugs on our [GitHub](https://github.com/methil-mods/methil-more-ores). Happy mining and battling!"
		},
