			"notes": "# Methil More Ores v0.0.1b !\nWelcome to the **Methil More Ores** mod for Minecraft 1.21.1, powered by **NeoForge** and **Kotlin For Forge** ! Enhance your mining and combat experience with new ores, tools, and armors.\n\n## Main Features\n- **Methil Ore**: A rare and valuable resource that can be mined in the Overworld, Deepslate layers, and even the Nether.\n- **Methil Armor**: Equip yourself with Methil Helmet, Chestplate, Leggings, and Boots for extra protection and agility.\n- **Methil Tools**: Mine faster and more efficiently with the Methil Pickaxe, Double Pickaxe, and more powerful tools.\n- **Emerald Armor and Tools**: Craft elegant and strong gear using emeralds for both protection and durability.\n\n## Installation Steps\n1. Install NeoForge.\n2. Download the Methil More Ores mod.\n3. Place the file in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n4. Launch Minecraft and enjoy the new features!\n\nFor support, report bugs on our [GitHub](https://github.com/methil-mods/methil-more-ores). Happy mining!"
		}
